      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUFFALO COWBOY (2) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (22.95) at Warragul in a Grade 5 over 400m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Expected to be right there at the finish again. STREET SIXTY SIX (1) stalked the lead but wound up strongly to score (23.21) at Geelong in Grade 5 over 400m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from seven starts. Expected to feature again. MISSY WHO (7) was out of the placings last time when fifth at Shepparton (22.37) but did record best time of the card when winning three back. The form from her last run stacks up well. Can do much better this time. TALTARNI LANE (3) has top-three aspirations after placing here over this journey last time.",
